infographic list-column-simple-vertical-arrow
data
  title Five flame-graph shapes — read the shape, find the fix
  desc An experienced eye reads the shape in seconds, before zooming into function names
  lists
    - label Tall narrow column, one path
      desc Recursion or a deep middleware chain. One fix, on the leaf or right below it.
    - label Wide plateau, many thin leaves
      desc A dispatcher fanning out to many handlers. Fix the dispatcher or the shared path above it, not any one handler.
    - label Two adjacent wide columns
      desc Two independent hot paths. Fix each separately; Amdahl applies to each independently.
    - label Volcano widening leaf-to-root
      desc Work distributed below one entry-point. Walk the shape to where real work becomes dispatch, and fix there.
    - label Thin spikes scattered across the width
      desc No real hotspot at all. The latency is off-CPU (I/O, locks, GC, network) — switch to an off-CPU or allocation profile.
theme
  palette #f59e0b #f43f5e #6366f1 #14b8a6
